#: Sidralune/Views/SettingsView.cs
msgid "Algorithms: IAU 2006 precession and nutation, JPL DE440 (SPK) or Standish/ELP2000 analytic ephemerides, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nKrisciunas & Schaefer sky brightness, Schaefer visual thresholds, triangle-invariant star matching with RANSAC, TAN-SIP WCS,\nstacking with kappa-sigma, winsorized, linear-fit and generalized-ESD rejection, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy with total variation (Dey et al.), starlet wavelets (Starck & Murtagh), generalized hyperbolic stretch,\nmulti-point lucky imaging, spherical planetary derotation, generalised Lomb-Scargle, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, Mandel-Agol-type transit model with ensemble MCMC."
msgstr "Algoritmos: precessão e nutação IAU 2006, JPL DE440 (SPK) ou efemérides analíticas Standish/ELP2000, SGP4 (Vallado 2006),\nbrilho do céu de Krisciunas & Schaefer, limiares visuais de Schaefer, emparelhamento de estrelas invariante por triângulos com RANSAC, WCS TAN-SIP,\nempilhamento com rejeição kappa-sigma, winsorizada, por ajuste linear e ESD generalizado, drizzle (Fruchter & Hook),\nRichardson-Lucy com variação total (Dey et al.), wavelets starlet (Starck & Murtagh), estiramento hiperbólico generalizado,\nlucky imaging multiponto, derrotação planetária esférica, Lomb-Scargle generalizado, BLS, PDM, Kwee-van Woerden, modelo de trânsito tipo Mandel-Agol com MCMC de conjunto."

